\p 
\v 1 \w Again there was a day| strong="H3117" \w* \w when the sons| strong="H1121" \w* \w of God| strong="H430" \w* [came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to present]{strong=“H3320” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8692”} themselves before the \sc Lord\sc*, \w and Satan| strong="H7854" \w* [came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w also among| strong="H8432" \w* [them to present]{strong=“H3320” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8692”} himself before the \sc Lord\sc*. 
