\v 12 For it is \w a fire| strong="H784" \w* that [consumeth]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to destruction| strong="H11" \w*, [and would root out]{strong=“H8327” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w all mine increase| strong="H8393" \w*. 
